Racial Traits ~ Shiko Me	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Cold|Immunity to Electricity|Shiko Me ~ Fiendish Immunities|Shiko Me ~ Black Lotus Sorcery|Shiko Me ~ Elemental Stance|Shiko Me ~ Hidden Weapons
Shiko Me ~ Fiendish Immunities	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.Immunity	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Immune to ability damage, ability drain, energy drain and negative energy; +3 bonus on saves against poison. A shiko me is a Tian fiend personifying the corruption of death (base creature: Jade Dragons and Hungry Ghosts p.42).	SOURCEPAGE:p.26
Shiko Me ~ Black Lotus Sorcery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Blood magic fueled by human blood and bone, black lotus powder and fiendish secretions: casts illusion and necromancy spells and spells of the Evil domain as a sorcerer; Evil domain spells count as arcane.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27
Shiko Me ~ Elemental Stance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Can assume an elemental combat stance as a swift action. Fire stance: burn (2d6), immunity to fire and burning hands at will. Wind stance: effectively invisible while motionless, fly 80 ft. (good), glitterdust and gust of wind at will.	SOURCEPAGE:p.27
Shiko Me ~ Hidden Weapons	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Carries weapons concealed about its person.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26
